# procedurally generated placeholder material -- see Switch_Key.obj
# Antique brass, fitting a key/lock mechanism. Same Kd+Ke reasoning as the
# other no-texture props this session (Stain_Dirt.mtl etc.): this shader
# (unlitTexturePS) only ever shows Kd*(ambient+light)+Ke when there's no
# texture, so a small Ke keeps it visible even in the map's unlit corners.
newmtl KeyMetal
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.550000 0.420000 0.150000
Ks 0.350000 0.350000 0.250000
Ke 0.040000 0.030000 0.015000
Ns 60.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
